  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e25",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "Ventricular fibrillation (VF)",
   "section_y": 136.2,
   "indent": 5,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Immediately restart CPR, starting with chest compressions.",
   "bbox": [
    81.4,
    322.7,
    311.1,
    333.5
   ],
   "key": "p17-856517c1"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e26",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "Ventricular fibrillation (VF)",
   "section_y": 136.2,
   "indent": 5,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Give adrenaline1 1mL (1:1000 solution) IV, followed by 5mL sterile water or sodium chloride 0.9%. Repeat adrenaline every 2 cycles (every 3-5 minutes).",
   "bbox": [
    81.4,
    332.7,
    681.4,
    343.5
   ],
   "key": "p17-d3d1d501"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e27",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "Ventricular fibrillation (VF)",
   "section_y": 136.2,
   "indent": 5,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "After every 2 minutes of CPR, pause compressions, recheck heart rhythm and manage as above.",
   "bbox": [
    81.4,
    342.5,
    464.1,
    353.5
   ],
   "key": "p17-5d8711c5"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e28",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "header",
   "section": "While giving continuous CPR",
   "section_y": 362.6,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "While giving continuous CPR",
   "bbox": [
    325.1,
    362.6,
    436.8,
    373.6
   ],
   "key": "p17-04208e07"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e29",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "Ventricular fibrillation (VF)",
   "section_y": 136.2,
   "indent": 2,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Doctor to consider intubation. If intubated, give 1 breath every 6 seconds and continuous chest compressions.",
   "bbox": [
    61.5,
    372.7,
    487.7,
    383.6
   ],
   "key": "p17-a9d132cd"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e30",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "Ventricular fibrillation (VF)",
   "section_y": 136.2,
   "indent": 2,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Look for and manage possible cause:",
   "bbox": [
    61.5,
    382.7,
    207.8,
    393.6
   ],
   "key": "p17-673e16f9"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e31",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "Ventricular fibrillation (VF)",
   "section_y": 136.2,
   "indent": 3,
   "parent": "p17-rb1-e30",
   "text": "If trauma, diarrhoea/vomiting or dehydration2, give sodium chloride 0.9% 1L IV rapidly. Repeat if needed. If unsure, discuss with doctor.",
   "bbox": [
    67.2,
    392.7,
    592.9,
    403.6
   ],
   "key": "p17-f6e804ae"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e32",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "Ventricular fibrillation (VF)",
   "section_y": 136.2,
   "indent": 3,
   "parent": "p17-rb1-e30",
   "text": "If glucose < 3 (< 4 if diabetes) or unable to measure 19. If temperature ≤ 35°C 18. If overdose/poisoning, discuss with specialist or poison helpline 200.",
   "bbox": [
    67.2,
    402.7,
    671.2,
    413.6
   ],
   "key": "p17-cd9acb7c"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e33",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "Ventricular fibrillation (VF)",
   "section_y": 136.2,
   "indent": 3,
   "parent": "p17-rb1-e30",
   "text": "If more resonant/decreased breath sounds on 1 side or deviated trachea, tension pneumothorax likely. Insert large bore cannula above the 6th rib, anterior axillary line. Arrange urgent chest tube.",
   "bbox": [
    67.2,
    412.6,
    685.8,
    433.6
   ],
   "key": "p17-4ff37dc2"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e34",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "header",
   "section": "Decide when to stop CPR",
   "section_y": 442.6,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Decide when to stop CPR",
   "bbox": [
    166.2,
    442.6,
    263.1,
    453.6
   ],
   "key": "p17-c722e4cf"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e35",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "header",
   "section": "How to give chest compressions",
   "section_y": 446.9,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "How to give chest compressions",
   "bbox": [
    528.2,
    446.9,
    655.5,
    458.1
   ],
   "key": "p17-426c53ca"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e36",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "Ventricular fibrillation (VF)",
   "section_y": 136.2,
   "indent": 1,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "If ongoing VF/pVT, temperature ≤ 35°C, snake bite or overdose/poisoning, continue CPR and discuss/transfer urgently.",
   "bbox": [
    56.4,
    452.8,
    345.8,
    473.6
   ],
   "key": "p17-79aa55c6"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e37",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "While giving continuous CPR",
   "section_y": 362.6,
   "indent": 1,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Ensure patient is lying on firm surface. If on bed, use backboard or move patient onto floor.",
   "bbox": [
    399.9,
    457.3,
    751.9,
    468.1
   ],
   "key": "p17-668834bf"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e38",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "While giving continuous CPR",
   "section_y": 362.6,
   "indent": 1,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Place heel of one hand over lower half of sternum. Place heel of second hand on top of first hand.",
   "bbox": [
    399.9,
    467.3,
    758.7,
    478.1
   ],
   "key": "p17-b184c953"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e39",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "Ventricular fibrillation (VF)",
   "section_y": 136.2,
   "indent": 1,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "If none of above or asystole after 20 minutes of continuous CPR or incurable underlying disease, consider stopping CPR in consultation with doctor.",
   "bbox": [
    56.4,
    472.8,
    353.5,
    493.6
   ],
   "key": "p17-b4c73754"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e40",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "While giving continuous CPR",
   "section_y": 362.6,
   "indent": 1,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Push down quickly, hard (depth of 5-6cm) and fast (100-120 per minute).",
   "bbox": [
    399.9,
    477.3,
    682.1,
    488.1
   ],
   "key": "p17-28aca3a5"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e41",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "While giving continuous CPR",
   "section_y": 362.6,
   "indent": 1,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Allow chest to return to normal shape between compressions.",
   "bbox": [
    399.9,
    487.3,
    642.4,
    498.1
   ],
   "key": "p17-55d5bc3f"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e42",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "Ventricular fibrillation (VF)",
   "section_y": 136.2,
   "indent": 2,
   "parent": "p17-rb1-e39",
   "text": "If CPR stopped, pronounce dead and arrange bereavement counselling for family.",
   "bbox": [
    62.1,
    492.8,
    370.6,
    503.6
   ],
   "key": "p17-31747a83"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e43",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "While giving continuous CPR",
   "section_y": 362.6,
   "indent": 1,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Do not interrupt compressions unless giving ventilations or checking heart rhythm.",
   "bbox": [
    399.9,
    497.3,
    723.4,
    508.1
   ],
   "key": "p17-2c45f8e0"
  },
  {
   "id": "p17-rb1-e44",
   "page": 17,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "unclassified",
   "section": "While giving continuous CPR",
   "section_y": 362.6,
   "indent": 1,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Swop with colleague every 2 minutes to avoid fatigue.",
   "bbox": [
    399.9,
    507.3,
    612.3,
    518.1
   ],
   "key": "p17-c3fb1162"
  },
  {
